{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:15:44Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough of the AutoMind AI Visual Design System implementation: typography, color tokens, spacing, radius, buttons, cards, inputs, badges, containers, loading and error states with Framer Motion.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# AutoMind AI — Visual Design System Walkthrough\\n\\n## Summary of Completed Design System\\n\\nThe visual design system for **AutoMind AI** has been created with a **cinematic, minimal, luxurious, futuristic, and dark** automotive aesthetic. The system emphasizes restraint, crisp alpha borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)`), and high-contrast telemetry accents.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Design System Architecture & Components\\n\\n```\\nfrontend/\\n├── app/\\n│   ├── globals.css                # Typography scale, subtle telemetry grid, range sliders, scrollbars\\n│   └── page.tsx                   # Interactive Design System Kitchen Sink / Showcase\\n├── components/\\n│   └── ui/\\n│       ├── typography.tsx         # Heading (H1-H4), Text, Eyebrow, Metric\\n│       ├── button.tsx             # Framer Motion spring button (primary, luxury, crimson, etc.)\\n│       ├── card.tsx               # Obsidian cards, telemetry stat cards with live status light\\n│       ├── input.tsx              # Text input with icon slots and shortcut badge (⌘K)\\n│       ├── select.tsx             # Precision dark dropdown select\\n│       ├── slider.tsx             # Dual/single range slider with value readout\\n│       ├── switch.tsx             # Tactile automotive toggle switch with spring physics\\n│       ├── badge.tsx              # Status chips, LiveBadge (pulsing beacon dot), SpecTag\\n│       ├── section.tsx            # Section, SectionHeader, and Grid primitives\\n│       ├── container.tsx          # Fluid responsive layout container (sm to full)\\n│       ├── skeleton.tsx           # CarCardSkeleton, SpecGridSkeleton, Pulse shimmers\\n│       ├── spinner.tsx            # Automotive HUD / Radar spinner\\n│       ├── alert.tsx              # High-contrast alert banners with dismiss/actions\\n│       ├── empty-state.tsx        # Cinematic zero-result recovery component\\n│       └── index.ts           \n<truncated 2926 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough artifact for visual design system\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chauh\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
