{"step_index":202,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:15:50Z","content":"# AutoMind AI — Visual Design System Created\n\nThe visual design system for **AutoMind AI** has been created in `frontend/` following a **cinematic, minimal, luxurious, futuristic, and dark** automotive design aesthetic.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Created\n\n#### 1. Global Typography & Foundations\n* **[`typography.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/typography.tsx)**:\n  * `Heading` (H1–H4) with high-contrast tracking and gradient/glow intents.\n  * `Eyebrow` for technical telemetry labels (e.g. `// 01 ARCHITECTURE`).\n  * `Metric` for large automotive telemetry stats with unit tags and deltas (`2.9s 0-60 MPH`).\n  * `Text` with `lead`, `body`, `small`, `muted`, and `mono` variants.\n* **[`globals.css`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/globals.css)**: Restrained glass surfaces (`glass-surface`), subtle telemetry grid, custom range sliders, and micro-scrollbars.\n\n#### 2. Color Tokens & Spacing Systems\n* **[`theme.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/lib/constants/theme.ts)** & **[`tailwind.config.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/tailwind.config.ts)**:\n  * **Obsidian Base**: `#06080C`\n  * **Carbon Surface**: `#0B0F17`\n  * **Cyber Cyan**: `#00F0FF` (Live actions, telemetry indicators)\n  * **Champagne Gold**: `#D4AF37` (Luxury AI recommendations & certified tags)\n  * **Hyper Crimson**: `#FF2A54` (Track mode, performance alerts)\n  * **Alpha Borders**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)` for crisp non-glare edges.\n  * **Border Radii**: `xs` (4px), `sm` (6px), `md` (10px), `lg` (14px), `xl` (20px), `full` (9999px).\n\n#### 3. Reusable Framer Motion Physics\n* **[`motion.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/lib/motion.ts)**: Tactile spring configurations (`SPRING_TRANSITION`, `GENTLE_SPRING`), cinematic easing curves, and stagger container variants.\n\n#### 4. Interactive Components & Micro-Interactions\n* **[`button.tsx`](file\n<truncated 1241 bytes>\nh.\n* **[`badge.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/badge.tsx)**: Status chips, `LiveBadge` with pulsing radar ping, and `SpecTag` (e.g. `MAKE: Porsche`).\n* **[`section.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/section.tsx)** & **[`container.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/container.tsx)**: `Section`, `SectionHeader` with eyebrow labels and actions, and responsive layout `Grid`.\n\n#### 5. Loading & Error States\n* **[`skeleton.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/skeleton.tsx)**: `CarCardSkeleton` for catalog loading and `SpecGridSkeleton` for telemetry.\n* **[`spinner.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/spinner.tsx)**: Automotive HUD / Radar spinner with rotating outer ring and pulsing core.\n* **[`alert.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/alert.tsx)**: Dismissable alert banners (`info`, `warning`, `error`, `success`).\n* **[`empty-state.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/empty-state.tsx)**: Cinematic zero-result recovery component with action button.\n\n#### 6. Interactive Design System Showcase\n* **[`app/page.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/app/page.tsx)**: Interactive showcase displaying every typography level, color token, button variant, card layout, input/slider/switch control, badge, skeleton loader, and error state with live state.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **TypeScript Typecheck (`npx tsc --noEmit`)**: **0 errors**.\n- **Next.js Production Build (`npm run build`)**: **Compiled successfully with all static pages optimized**.\n\nDetails are documented in the [Walkthrough Artifact](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/brain/10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1/walkthrough.md).","truncated_fields":["content"]}
