{"step_index":234,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:17:54Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough update including AutoMind AI responsive Navbar component, sticky blurred background, active-link indicators, mobile drawer, and verification results.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# AutoMind AI — Navbar Implementation Walkthrough\\n\\n## Summary of Completed Work\\n\\nThe production-ready **AutoMind AI Navbar** has been implemented and integrated into the global layout, adhering to the cinematic, minimal, dark automotive design system.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Navbar Architecture & Features\\n\\n### Desktop Navigation\\n- **Branding**: Geometric `AM` monogram logo with cyan gradient and high-contrast typography linking to `/`.\\n- **Navigation Links**:\\n  - **Explore** (`/explore`)\\n  - **AI Finder** (`/ai-finder`) — with `Smart Match` badge and pulsing AI sparkle icon\\n  - **Compare** (`/compare`)\\n  - **Price Predictor** (`/price-predictor`) — with `ML` telemetry badge\\n  - **AI Assistant** (`/ai-assistant`) — with `Gemini` badge and AI sparkle icon\\n- **CTA**: `\\\"Find My Car\\\"` button styled in primary cyber cyan with hover physics, routing to the AI vehicle matching workflow (`/ai-finder`).\\n- **Active State & Micro-Interactions**:\\n  - Framer Motion `layoutId=\\\"navbar-active\\\"` pill background + cyan active underline glow.\\n  - Smooth spring-based hover pill (`layoutId=\\\"navbar-hover\\\"`).\\n  - Scroll detection dynamically elevating background opacity and shadow when scrolling down.\\n\\n### Mobile Navigation\\n- Accessible hamburger button with animated state transition (`Menu` $\\\\leftrightarrow$ `X`).\\n- Full-height backdrop blur overlay (`backdrop-blur-sm`).\\n- Collapsible drawer menu with individual link cards displaying titles, badges, descriptions, and chevron arrows.\\n- Full-width mobile `\\\"Find My Car\\\"` CTA button.\\n- Keyboard accessibility: Escape key closes menu, scroll-locking when open, explicit `aria-expanded` and `aria-controls`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. File Manifest\\n\\n- [`frontend/components/layout/navbar.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/layout/navbar.tsx) — Main Navbar component with desktop/mobile navigation, scroll detection, and Framer Motion transitions.\\n- [`frontend/components/layout/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemin\n<truncated 723 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough artifact for Navbar implementation\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chauh\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
